text2skin-anthra-SD Revision History
------------------------------------------------------

2014-03-24: Version 0.3.2
- Some small fixes 
- Adjustments for compatibility with VDR-2.x.x


2013-10-27: Version 0.3.1
-  Added support for channellogos with ChannelIds


2013-04-14: Version 0.3.0
- Added DiskUsage and VDR-Version to mainmenu


2011-11-03: Version 0.2.9
- Added optional bars for Signal Strength and Signal-to-Noise Ratio
- Extended marquee-configuration for menus
- Fixed update of Signal Strength and Signal-to-Noise Ratio
  while zapping


2011-10-22: Version 0.2.8
- Switched screenBase from absolute to relative,
  anthra-SD is vertically scalable now
- Applied tiny patch for Makefile (patch by Ville Skyttä)
- Some graphical reworking
- Switched aspect ratio of channellogos from 4:3 to 16:9
  hence http://justlinux.de/vdr/liquid-logos4anthra_HD-0.1.tar.gz
  should be used now!


2011-01-07: Version 0.2.7
- Fixed size of replayInfo-window


2010-12-11: Version 0.2.6
- Makefile fixed


2010-10-29: Version 0.2.5
- Removed needless spaces after "align" (patch by Ville Skyttä)
- Added EPGIMAGES (patch by Midas@vdrportal.de)
- Splitted anthra_SD.template into separate files
- Changed path for channellogos from relative to absolute
- Outsourced user-defined Makefile-variables into Make.config


2010-10-23: Version 0.2.4
- Added NOMARQUEE-option in Makefile
- Added HISTORY


2010-10-21: Version 0.2.3
- Added *.po-files
- Added license
- Added README
